line	
line	<str>Use the icon segments on one another to create the strange icon and then talk with Ketla.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the drain in the centre of the Residential District.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the door in front of you and down the ladder to the east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Interact with the ancient pillar.</str>
line	
line	<str>After finishing the conversation with Ketla, search the workbench for the perfected shadow torch.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the Shadow Realm and destroy the tentacles blocking the entrance to the cathedral.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run towards the water of the Sunken Cathedral in the real world.</str>
line	
line	<str>The final boss is weak to Magic. You will need to Prayer switch often. See The Whisperer for specific details on the boss fight.</str>
line	
line	<str>Attempt to return the last medallion but get knocked unconscious by a rigged area.</str>
line	
line	<str>Find a hair clip in the bed to unlock the cell, and retrieve your items in the chest to east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Inspect the altar to the west.</str>
line	
line	<str>Fight a Mysterious Figure who launches dangerous orbs after freezing you. Spam click away while frozen to dodge.</str>
line	
