done	<str>Give the shadow blocker schematic you picked up earlier to Ketla , then search the workbench for a shadow blocker.</str>
done	
done	<str>Activate the teleporter just south-west of Ketla's building.</str>
done	
done	<str>Head to the building with the furnaces in the Science District.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the building, and place the shadow blocker in front of the locked doors.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the Shadow Realm from the black puddle nearby and pick the lock on the doors.</str>
done	
done	<str>Take the basic shadow torch schematic from the north room.</str>
done	
done	<str>Use the blackstone fragment to leave the Shadow Realm, then right-click "Recall" on it to retrieve your shadow blocker.</str>
done	
done	<str>Use the nearest teleporter and select the western Residential District.</str>
done	
done	<str>Bring the schematic to Ketla and retrieve the basic shadow torch.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the Shadow Realm from the puddle in the Residential District.</str>
done	
done	<str>Destroy the tentacles at the doors east of the black puddle.</str>
done	
done	<str>Return to the real world and pick up the revitalising idol schematic from the building.</str>
done	
done	<str>Before returning to Ketla, head east and activate the last teleporter, then use it to teleport to the western Residential District.</str>
done	
done	<str>Bring the schematic to Ketla and retrieve the revitalising idol.</str>
done	
done	<str>Use the teleporter and head back to the Eastern Residential District.</str>
done	
done	<str>Place the revitalising idol next to the teleporter.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the Shadow Realm from the same puddle as before, and touch the revitalising idol, which will restore 50% of your sanity.</str>
done	
done	<str>Keep running north and around until you are at the door with the tentacles, then destroy it</str>
done	
done	<str>Pick up the blue shadow key in the north-west corner of the building. (If your sanity is running low after destroying the tentacles, you may retrieve the shadow key in the real world instead.)</str>
done	
done	<str>Head to the pub (link=no) next to the western Residential District teleporter.</str>
done	
done	<str>Place the shadow blocker next to the entrance, then enter the Shadow Realm and picklock the doors.</str>
done	
done	<str>Once the doors are unlocked, enter and pick up the schematic.</str>
done	
done	<str>Bring the schematic to Ketla and retrieve the superior shadow torch.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the Shadow Realm via the Science District.</str>
done	
done	<str>Make your way around the north-western building and destroy the tentacle on top of the stairs to the north.</str>
done	
done	<str>Pick up the anima portal schematic and return to the real world.</str>
done	
done	<str>Bring the schematic to Ketla and retrieve the anima portal.</str>
done	
done	<str>Teleport to the Plaza and enter the Shadow Realm from there.</str>
done	
done	<str>Destroy the tentacles at the building to the south-west and pick up the white shadow key.</str>
done	
done	<str>Right-click "Recall" on the blackstone fragment to get your devices back.</str>
done	
done	<str>Exit the building and teleport to the Palace.</str>
done	
done	<str>Head to the north-west corner of the Palace, where the locked chest is.</str>
done	
done	<str>Place the shadow blocker in front of the chest, the anima portal between the two braziers, and the revitalising idol several tiles south-east of the anima portal.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the Shadow Realm from the Plaza, then make your way back to the Palace, using the revitalising idol as needed.</str>
done	
done	<str>Light the four braziers around the locked chest.</str>
done	
done	<str>Open the chest for the perfected shadow torch schematic.</str>
done	
done	<str>Return to the real world, recall your devices, and give the schematic to Ketla.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the pub from the Shadow Realm.</str>
done	
done	<str>Head upstairs and touch the remnant (your sanity will not lower when viewing the remnant).</str>
done	
done	<str>Return to the real world, and reenter the Shadow Realm once your sanity is replenished.</str>
done	
done	<str>Burn the tentacles from the doors of the building next to the Cathedral teleporter, and then the tentacles from the other building just west.</str>
done	
done	<str>Return to the real world and pick up the red shadow key from the rectangular building.</str>
done	
done	<str>Head inside the square building to the east, then place the shadow blocker by the chest.</str>
done	
done	<str>Picklock the chest from within the Shadow Realm for one half of the icon segment.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the Shadow Realm from the Science District.</str>
done	
done	<str>Head south to the building next to the South Science District teleporter.</str>
done	
done	<str>Destroy the tentacle there and open the chest inside.</str>
done	
done	<str>Use the icon segments on one another to create the strange icon and then talk with Ketla.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the drain in the centre of the Residential District.</str>
done	
done	<str>Go through the door in front of you and down the ladder to the east.</str>
done	
done	<str>Interact with the ancient pillar.</str>
done	
done	<str>After finishing the conversation with Ketla, search the workbench for the perfected shadow torch.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the Shadow Realm and destroy the tentacles blocking the entrance to the cathedral.</str>
done	
done	<str>Run towards the water of the Sunken Cathedral in the real world.</str>
done	
done	<str>The final boss is weak to Magic. You will need to Prayer switch often. See The Whisperer for specific details on the boss fight.</str>
done	
done	<str>Attempt to return the last medallion but get knocked unconscious by a rigged area.</str>
done	
done	<str>Find a hair clip in the bed to unlock the cell, and retrieve your items in the chest to east.</str>
done	
done	<str>Inspect the altar to the west.</str>
done	
done	<str>Fight a Mysterious Figure who launches dangerous orbs after freezing you. Spam click away while frozen to dodge.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the Ancient Vault and finish the cutscene.</str>
done	
done	<str>You must now fight each of Sliske's wights one by one. Bring high ranged defence armour to deal with Ketla's clones. If you teleport out or die you must re-start the entire fight from the first clone. It is best to use a range weapon with high accuracy for each stage of the boss such as a crossbow.</str>
done	
done	<str>Finish the conversation with Azzanadra.</str>
done	
done	<col=ff0000>QUEST COMPLETE!</col>
